{
  "notes": "pp2-tp2-ring stacking confirmed winners: intra-stage sp_prefill + lockstep PP adaptive verification (rc=0.032, c1_scale=1.55, tau=0.2) + VLLM_SINK_REJECTION=1 (16K batch, 12/12/15 L2 prefetch, full 0854 balance)",
